Thought: To start the rigorous model comparison benchmark, I need to load the necessary datasets and prepare the models for comparison. I will use the load_dataset_summary tool to get the summary statistics for both the wine and breast_cancer datasets. Then, I will use the train_sklearn_model tool to train a Random Forest classifier on both datasets. Next, I will use the tune_hyperparameters tool to tune the hyperparameters of a kernel SVM on the wine dataset. After that, I will use the train_deep_classifier tool to train a regularised deep neural network on the breast_cancer dataset.

